  "duration": 60280000,
  "fps": 30,
  "materials": {
    "videos": [
      {
        "id": "5dd9cb4e-ae72-4f2a-9772-01665d0be869",
        "path": "E:\\代码\\美食街\\live-cutter\\recordings\\21-16-03_东方甄选_p044.mp4",
        "type": "video",
        "duration": 3600000000,
        "width": 1080,
        "height": 1920
      }
    ],
    "texts": [
      {
        "id": "54f2567d-e551-4fb6-8952-9094180b1075",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"高温 然后定时给它定一个八小时\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "59162df6-5b41-4b7f-af47-ca6485721676",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"你看这种程度咱们这个现在是温分热热的\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "c94621ae-5003-41c8-bf1f-3f96e2298809",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"把它泡水里 我赶把手伸到这个放着工作的电热坦的水中\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "e4cd1127-2bd1-431c-a727-f679b84e63bb",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"正在工作正在使用的电热坦泡在水里吧\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "446f4095-a145-4489-b023-8cc0799ad119",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"朋友们 我赶把手伸进去 各位\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "81433216-cb2a-434d-83fe-60b64322d5ce",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"这实际上够计端了吧 对不对\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "fc82a859-a15f-4979-9c28-e628c82b04e4",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"咱们这一款虽然说不能这个水洗\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "9f10b283-cb84-4dba-b0da-68211db16f66",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"但是我们告诉大家\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "b9a9c9b4-6a16-4853-b70d-1111f3894db3",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"比如脱水 或者说孩子要跟你要在上面\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "c293f898-e788-46b8-b89e-f4a5c90856aa",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"是很安心的 不用这个担忧\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "7157b322-a626-48fc-ab3b-8bec1caae7da",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"那么今天这么好的电热坦给大家做了这个专场机制\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "5f2c8d56-e3a3-4fd1-aaa5-a6fb5f4336b0",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"然后这个案一名五的 这是主流的一个这个吃饭吗\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "ed7f833e-1997-4265-87ee-bf559944e8cf",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"一百八日酒 日常价格 要卖到这个一百八日酒\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "f5e25a23-cb2d-413c-b683-76a2e0a197c2",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"然后今天的咱们给大家做专场机制\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "ee4dfb1b-cdda-42fe-bb08-04bf6c2c8643",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"先双是一个点剪三十三\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "4816b81a-34ad-44e8-b83b-1f833d8a1271",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"所以你真的不用等了三十三块钱\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "73b53d48-049e-4546-966f-37968990f816",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"谁百给你三十三呀\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "f5586aa9-84ac-4bac-9413-93ce6b514051",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"而且还有专场机制再给你剪三十三\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "29b21b24-de98-46dc-953b-3d4b50d7ae62",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"离外离剪了六十多块钱\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "bc5cb0d5-ddfc-4468-a1ae-cc0615c2f31b",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"一百二六 相当于打了个六折\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "0192e12c-d000-4225-887e-452639a9e8a5",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"那而且的话咱们还要不同的这个尺寸可以旋\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "30b03d1b-e87b-4db8-bb2c-a97d63a86220",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"您是一名五的床 但您就来找了\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "de89fca0-f7fe-46b5-9a30-0e6327360a7c",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"那一百\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      }
    ],
